1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,993
Aapka paisa double kab hoga?

2
00:00:02,013 --> 00:00:04,137
Bas 72 ko divide karo.

3
00:00:04,157 --> 00:00:06,091
Ise Rule of 72 kehte hain:

4
00:00:06,111 --> 00:00:07,921
72 ko saal ke return se

5
00:00:07,941 --> 00:00:08,774
divide karo,

6
00:00:08,794 --> 00:00:10,132
aur mil gaye saal.

7
00:00:10,152 --> 00:00:13,042
PPF abhi 7.1% de raha hai.

8
00:00:13,062 --> 00:00:14,588
72 divide 7.1,

9
00:00:14,608 --> 00:00:16,551
kareeb 10 saal.

10
00:00:16,571 --> 00:00:17,805
Matlab ₹1 lakh,

11
00:00:17,825 --> 00:00:20,000
10 saal mein ₹2 lakh.

12
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:21,660
Equity mein 12% saal ka

13
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:22,372
maan lein,

14
00:00:22,392 --> 00:00:23,705
jo guaranteed nahi hai,

15
00:00:23,725 --> 00:00:25,140
toh sirf 6 saal.

16
00:00:25,160 --> 00:00:26,095
Aur 30 saal mein?

17
00:00:26,115 --> 00:00:27,494
Kareeb 5 baar double.

18
00:00:27,514 --> 00:00:28,604
₹1 lakh se 2,

19
00:00:28,624 --> 00:00:29,441
4,

20
00:00:29,461 --> 00:00:29,392
8,

21
00:00:29,412 --> 00:00:30,200
16,

22
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:31,422
aur 30 saal pe,

23
00:00:31,442 --> 00:00:33,150
kareeb ₹30 lakh.

24
00:00:33,170 --> 00:00:34,585
Yahi rule ulta bhi chalta

25
00:00:34,605 --> 00:00:34,816
hai.

26
00:00:34,836 --> 00:00:37,060
Mehngai 6% maan lein,

27
00:00:37,080 --> 00:00:38,639
toh 12 saal mein cheezein

28
00:00:38,659 --> 00:00:39,674
double mehngi.

29
00:00:39,694 --> 00:00:41,223
Aaj ka ₹100 ka saamaan,

30
00:00:41,243 --> 00:00:42,977
12 saal baad ₹200 ka.

31
00:00:42,997 --> 00:00:44,286
Toh asli sawaal:

32
00:00:44,306 --> 00:00:45,911
aapka paisa kitni speed

33
00:00:45,931 --> 00:00:47,699
se double ho raha hai?

34
00:00:47,719 --> 00:00:50,732
Follow karo The 7% Club!
